1
00:00:01,805 --> 00:00:04,474
Come on, Hijiri,
I already told you.

2
00:00:05,058 --> 00:00:06,977
Don't bother asking me out.

3
00:00:08,020 --> 00:00:10,981
But Tsuchiya said,
that meant I should ask you out.

4
00:00:11,064 --> 00:00:12,232
Tsuchiya!

5
00:00:12,315 --> 00:00:13,984
Sincerest apologies.

6
00:00:14,693 --> 00:00:16,987
I looked into
some places normal folk enjoy.

7
00:00:17,779 --> 00:00:20,240
I'd appreciate it
if you'd show some gratitude

8
00:00:20,323 --> 00:00:22,200
that you are able to date me.

9
00:00:24,786 --> 00:00:26,455
I'm not a realistic

10
00:00:26,538 --> 00:00:28,957
potential romantic partner for you, am I?

11
00:00:29,041 --> 00:00:30,500
What are you saying?

12
00:00:30,584 --> 00:00:32,961
I'll have you know,
every woman in the world sees me

13
00:00:33,045 --> 00:00:35,505
as a potential romantic partner for them.

14
00:00:36,089 --> 00:00:38,550
All right. I'm about to beat you at drums.

15
00:00:38,633 --> 00:00:40,385
No whining if I hit you by accident.

16
00:00:40,469 --> 00:00:42,512
Sorry, that one's not interesting.

17
00:00:44,222 --> 00:00:46,016
Why don't we play this one over here?

18
00:00:47,184 --> 00:00:48,018
Oh.

19
00:00:48,852 --> 00:00:51,521
That plushie toy I wanted
last time is still there.

20
00:00:52,105 --> 00:00:54,691
Rio took all of our prizes home
that night.

21
00:00:54,775 --> 00:00:56,276
-What?
-Hmm?

22
00:00:56,359 --> 00:00:57,944
I'd still plan a better date.

23
00:00:58,028 --> 00:01:00,322
There's no way
you know her as well as I do.

24
00:01:01,114 --> 00:01:02,949
Your disrespectful cousin.

25
00:01:03,909 --> 00:01:06,787
All right, I'll buy everything in there.

26
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,081
Will my paycheck cover it, Tsuchiya?

27
00:01:09,164 --> 00:01:10,791
Allow me to check with the manager.

28
00:01:10,874 --> 00:01:12,834
Just play the game, please!

29
00:01:12,918 --> 00:01:16,046
Why bother with that part of it?
I really don't understand.

30
00:01:16,129 --> 00:01:16,963
Hmm.

31
00:01:17,047 --> 00:01:19,132
Hey, I know. Let's hit the photo booth.

32
00:01:19,633 --> 00:01:22,219
-Whoa!
-Mr. Tsuchiya, come on!

33
00:01:22,302 --> 00:01:23,470
You want me in it?

34
00:01:23,553 --> 00:01:24,471
Yup.

35
00:01:30,018 --> 00:01:31,603
Hurry, Mr. Tsuchiya!

36
00:01:32,104 --> 00:01:32,979
Yes, miss.

37
00:01:38,235 --> 00:01:40,112
Give me a hot pose!

38
00:01:40,195 --> 00:01:41,780
-Oh. Right there, the camera.
-Hmm.

39
00:01:41,863 --> 00:01:44,658
Three, two, one.

40
00:01:46,493 --> 00:01:47,327
SP TRIO

41
00:01:47,410 --> 00:01:49,746
Somehow we do always end up
having fun together.

42
00:01:51,665 --> 00:01:53,959
-Miss Anzu Hoshino.
-Hmm?

43
00:01:55,377 --> 00:01:56,837
Nice to meet you.

44
00:01:57,504 --> 00:01:59,548
How are you? My name's Yukana Kishi.

45
00:02:00,465 --> 00:02:03,844
Tsukasa, he lives with you
at your place, isn't that right?

46
00:02:05,095 --> 00:02:06,555
Um…

47
00:02:08,140 --> 00:02:09,349
We've been together,

48
00:02:10,392 --> 00:02:13,478
for, well, I'd say for quite a while now.

49
00:03:46,196 --> 00:03:49,241
#11 JUST TELL ME IF YOU DON'T LIKE IT

50
00:03:49,324 --> 00:03:50,408
Mr. Hijiri.

51
00:03:50,492 --> 00:03:51,493
What is it?

52
00:03:51,576 --> 00:03:55,163
Well, I thought I was seeing things,
so I kept quiet at first.

53
00:03:55,997 --> 00:03:58,959
But I could sense someone's eye
on us all day today.

54
00:04:00,168 --> 00:04:02,545
We parted ways
with Miss Hoshino at the station,

55
00:04:02,629 --> 00:04:04,297
but I must say I'm concerned.

56
00:04:07,300 --> 00:04:08,760
I can check up on her.

57
00:04:10,053 --> 00:04:12,514
So you're Kazuki's, uh, girlfriend?

58
00:04:12,597 --> 00:04:13,765
Yes, I am.

59
00:04:13,848 --> 00:04:16,685
But everybody who's close to us is
against it for some reason,

60
00:04:16,768 --> 00:04:18,895
so I'm never allowed to see him anymore.

61
00:04:19,604 --> 00:04:21,064
It's terrible, isn't it?

62
00:04:21,564 --> 00:04:23,900
Tearing lovers apart that way?

63
00:04:23,984 --> 00:04:25,151
I don't know.

64
00:04:25,235 --> 00:04:28,280
I just don't see Kazuki
being with someone like her.

65
00:04:28,863 --> 00:04:31,408
His sister
is truly an evil person,

66
00:04:31,491 --> 00:04:34,286
the complete opposite of my sweet Tsukasa.

67
00:04:34,369 --> 00:04:35,912
I just don't know.

68
00:04:36,871 --> 00:04:38,164
Something feels off.

69
00:04:50,468 --> 00:04:52,178
I've been searching frantically

70
00:04:52,262 --> 00:04:54,014
because no one would tell me
where he moved.

71
00:04:54,973 --> 00:04:57,058
And I found him thanks to social media.

72
00:04:57,142 --> 00:04:59,060
WITH CHOYO. LOOK AT THE HOTTIE
IN THE BACKGROUND.

73
00:04:59,144 --> 00:05:00,645
What?

74
00:05:10,405 --> 00:05:12,991
How come… you're…

75
00:05:14,159 --> 00:05:16,453
Tsukasa!

76
00:05:20,165 --> 00:05:22,542
Whoa, this is bad.

77
00:05:31,051 --> 00:05:32,969
I'm sorry, but he's busy.

78
00:05:34,012 --> 00:05:35,972
So please, time for you to leave.

79
00:05:52,572 --> 00:05:55,075
Man,
Kazuki's really sweating over there.

80
00:05:56,284 --> 00:05:57,118
Hmm.

81
00:06:09,881 --> 00:06:11,508
She's gone now, Kazuki.

82
00:06:12,717 --> 00:06:15,553
How did she,
how did she approach you?

83
00:06:16,054 --> 00:06:19,391
Well, she called out my name
when I was walking home.

84
00:06:22,060 --> 00:06:25,063
Then she told me
that she was your girlfriend.

85
00:06:27,023 --> 00:06:28,108
Kazuki!

86
00:06:31,236 --> 00:06:33,696
And, did you, did you believe her?

87
00:06:33,780 --> 00:06:34,614
Mm-mm.

88
00:06:35,740 --> 00:06:38,118
No, I didn't. Something felt off.

89
00:06:45,041 --> 00:06:46,209
She's, uh…

90
00:06:47,293 --> 00:06:48,503
She's my stalker.

91
00:06:49,003 --> 00:06:50,004
What?

92
00:06:58,680 --> 00:07:01,141
I'm starting
to feel a lot better now.

93
00:07:01,641 --> 00:07:03,977
I'll get you
something to drink. Uh?

94
00:07:07,105 --> 00:07:08,731
Stay with me a little longer.

95
00:07:10,483 --> 00:07:13,695
Jeez, his hands are super cold.

96
00:07:15,280 --> 00:07:16,281
Sorry.

97
00:07:16,364 --> 00:07:17,490
It's okay.

98
00:07:17,574 --> 00:07:21,161
I'm really sorry too.
I shouldn't have even talked to her.

99
00:07:22,203 --> 00:07:23,621
It's not your fault.

100
00:07:24,247 --> 00:07:27,125
Knowing how she is,
she already had your address.

101
00:07:28,126 --> 00:07:29,169
Anyway.

102
00:07:32,338 --> 00:07:34,507
You knew. You could sense it.

103
00:07:38,219 --> 00:07:41,848
Well, I did say I would tell you
why I was living alone.

104
00:07:43,308 --> 00:07:45,393
You shouldn't feel pressured
to talk about it.

105
00:07:49,481 --> 00:07:51,941
I want to, Hoshino.

106
00:07:53,276 --> 00:07:54,652
Here's how it happened.

107
00:07:55,862 --> 00:07:57,864
-You know that book I wanted?
-Oh yeah.

108
00:07:57,947 --> 00:07:59,741
-Well, dude, I really--
-Huh?

109
00:08:01,534 --> 00:08:02,619
Are you okay?

110
00:08:04,704 --> 00:08:05,955
Here.

111
00:08:12,670 --> 00:08:14,005
Thank you very much.

112
00:08:14,506 --> 00:08:16,716
All I did was give her the bag.

113
00:08:18,801 --> 00:08:21,221
-Hey, remember that book?
-Yeah, did you get it?

114
00:08:21,304 --> 00:08:22,805
-I did, man, for nearly after…
-Morning.

115
00:08:22,889 --> 00:08:24,224
Oh. Good morning.

116
00:08:27,185 --> 00:08:28,228
Morning.

117
00:08:29,187 --> 00:08:30,230
Morning.

118
00:08:32,899 --> 00:08:34,359
Hello.

119
00:08:35,818 --> 00:08:38,196
That chick's here for you,
like, every day.

120
00:08:38,279 --> 00:08:39,113
Mm-hm.

121
00:08:39,197 --> 00:08:41,324
Hey, she must like you a lot, my dude.

122
00:08:42,534 --> 00:08:44,202
Nah,
I'm sure it's not like that.

123
00:08:44,285 --> 00:08:46,663
Man, it must be nice
to be so good-looking.

124
00:08:48,706 --> 00:08:49,749
Delivery.

125
00:08:49,832 --> 00:08:50,875
TO: TSUKASA KAZUKI

126
00:08:50,959 --> 00:08:52,001
For me?

127
00:08:56,464 --> 00:08:57,298
Hmm.

128
00:08:59,801 --> 00:09:00,635
Hmm?

129
00:09:05,223 --> 00:09:07,016
And it totally freaked me out.

130
00:09:07,100 --> 00:09:09,644
-That makes sense.
-Hey, Mom, about this shirt…

131
00:09:09,727 --> 00:09:11,521
Oh, is that a new one?

132
00:09:11,604 --> 00:09:13,106
Did Arisa get it for you?

133
00:09:13,189 --> 00:09:15,149
What? No, I didn't get it for him.

134
00:09:15,733 --> 00:09:17,902
Huh?

135
00:09:17,986 --> 00:09:19,862
No, dude,
it was just like I thought.

136
00:09:19,946 --> 00:09:20,905
He's confiscating everything.

137
00:09:20,989 --> 00:09:22,490
-So your brother had…
-Oh, really? That's crazy.

138
00:09:22,574 --> 00:09:23,408
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

139
00:09:23,491 --> 00:09:25,660
That dude would take
all my stuff without asking.

140
00:09:25,743 --> 00:09:26,911
Morning.

141
00:09:27,495 --> 00:09:30,415
That shirt looks so good on you.

142
00:09:31,374 --> 00:09:32,375
What?

143
00:09:48,641 --> 00:09:50,059
So disturbing.

144
00:09:50,143 --> 00:09:52,729
Someone created multiple accounts
for different websites

145
00:09:52,812 --> 00:09:54,564
using my name without my permission.

146
00:09:54,647 --> 00:09:57,066
Thank goodness
the purchases weren't billed to you.

147
00:09:57,150 --> 00:09:58,818
But this is still serious.

148
00:09:58,901 --> 00:10:00,570
I think we should speak to the police.

149
00:10:01,362 --> 00:10:04,073
There's no reason
to involve the police. Shame on you!

150
00:10:04,949 --> 00:10:05,992
Tsukasa.

151
00:10:06,075 --> 00:10:09,078
You're making these purchases
using your mom's name, aren't you?

152
00:10:09,162 --> 00:10:10,330
-No--
-Do you really think

153
00:10:10,413 --> 00:10:12,081
Tsukasa would ever do that?

154
00:10:12,165 --> 00:10:14,459
-Don't talk to your father that way.
-Huh…

155
00:10:15,668 --> 00:10:19,464
Anyway, let's just
return the packages unopened for now.

156
00:10:22,675 --> 00:10:25,470
Tsukasa,
you like the gifts I send?

157
00:10:26,679 --> 00:10:29,474
I knew it. You sent everything.

158
00:10:30,266 --> 00:10:31,601
Hmm.

159
00:10:31,684 --> 00:10:33,353
Why are you doing this?

160
00:10:34,020 --> 00:10:36,814
Oh. I'm sorry,
I didn't mean to bother you.

161
00:10:37,398 --> 00:10:39,859
I should have asked
what kind of clothes you like first.

162
00:10:40,526 --> 00:10:42,195
No, that's not what I mean.

163
00:10:42,278 --> 00:10:44,364
You made a bunch of accounts
using my mom's name.

164
00:10:44,447 --> 00:10:48,493
Well I, I haven't really met
your family yet, so,

165
00:10:48,576 --> 00:10:50,745
are you worried about what they may think?

166
00:10:51,788 --> 00:10:53,456
Embarrassed if they found out about us?

167
00:10:54,457 --> 00:10:55,875
What are you…

168
00:10:55,958 --> 00:10:57,377
So…

169
00:10:58,461 --> 00:10:59,837
What clothes do you like, then?

170
00:11:00,963 --> 00:11:02,882
Just tell me, Tsukasa.

171
00:11:11,474 --> 00:11:13,893
Please, just don't send me anything else

172
00:11:13,976 --> 00:11:16,062
ever again. Just leave me alone.

173
00:11:22,652 --> 00:11:24,195
-Hey, so check it out.
-What's up?

174
00:11:24,278 --> 00:11:25,571
Remember what my big brother did?

175
00:11:25,655 --> 00:11:27,740
-No.
-Well, I ratted him out to my mom.

176
00:11:27,824 --> 00:11:28,908
It's pretty crazy, right?

177
00:11:28,991 --> 00:11:30,159
No way, dude.

178
00:11:30,910 --> 00:11:33,871
Hey, isn't that the girl who waits
for you, like, every single morning?

179
00:11:34,622 --> 00:11:36,165
What? Uh, I don't know.

180
00:11:36,249 --> 00:11:37,583
-Hmm?
-Hmm.

181
00:11:45,675 --> 00:11:47,927
See you later, dude.
Have fun tonight.

182
00:11:48,594 --> 00:11:50,722
-Yay!
-We have a test tomorrow.

183
00:12:20,793 --> 00:12:23,629
Oh, Tsukasa,
you're so shy, aren't you?

184
00:12:24,839 --> 00:12:28,217
I understand that you don't want anyone
close to you to know about us.

185
00:12:29,927 --> 00:12:32,472
Since I still get to see you every day,

186
00:12:32,555 --> 00:12:35,308
I can suffer
through us not being able to speak.

187
00:12:36,517 --> 00:12:38,311
My sweet Tsukasa.

188
00:12:39,270 --> 00:12:40,438
Seems everyone else…

189
00:12:41,522 --> 00:12:42,565
is in the way.

190
00:12:42,648 --> 00:12:44,066
GIRLS MY AGE ARE ANNOYING AND CREEPY

191
00:12:44,150 --> 00:12:45,568
ALL GUYS ARE IMMATURE.
I WISH THEY LEFT ME ALONE.

192
00:12:45,651 --> 00:12:48,696
Isn't that the chick who's always
waiting for you on our way to school?

193
00:12:48,780 --> 00:12:51,157
Excuse me,
you're dating older women now?

194
00:12:51,240 --> 00:12:52,241
SECOND ACCOUNT OF A STUDENT.
MAINLY COMPLAINTS.

195
00:12:52,325 --> 00:12:54,327
Dude, how are you
gonna talk trash about us online?

196
00:12:54,410 --> 00:12:56,120
She's obviously
trying to get with me.

197
00:12:56,204 --> 00:12:57,455
He can't just diss me like that.

198
00:12:57,538 --> 00:12:58,790
What the hell is that post, dude?

199
00:12:58,873 --> 00:13:00,583
Tsukasa, you're legit the worst.

200
00:13:00,666 --> 00:13:02,752
I can't believe
you're so two-faced, man!

201
00:13:06,088 --> 00:13:07,048
Hey!

202
00:13:07,840 --> 00:13:09,717
You have some woman following you

203
00:13:09,801 --> 00:13:11,385
who put a wire and a camera on you?

204
00:13:11,469 --> 00:13:12,720
Disgraceful!

205
00:13:12,804 --> 00:13:14,430
It's not Tsukasa's fault, Dad!

206
00:13:14,514 --> 00:13:16,224
He is the victim here.

207
00:13:16,307 --> 00:13:18,392
This happened
because you lead her on.

208
00:13:18,476 --> 00:13:20,019
You're not sincere with people.

209
00:13:25,608 --> 00:13:27,235
Tsukasa.

210
00:13:28,110 --> 00:13:29,237
This is awful.

211
00:13:30,238 --> 00:13:33,032
All everyone wants to do was
pull us apart.

212
00:13:33,783 --> 00:13:36,327
And we're so deeply in love
with each other--

213
00:13:39,121 --> 00:13:42,041
Go away!
We have a restraining order against you!

214
00:13:42,124 --> 00:13:45,044
So unless you wanna spend
the rest of your life in jail,

215
00:13:45,670 --> 00:13:47,672
don't come near my brother ever again!

216
00:13:50,341 --> 00:13:51,592
I'm off to school.

217
00:14:13,030 --> 00:14:15,575
Tsukasa.

218
00:14:17,535 --> 00:14:18,744
And after all that,

219
00:14:19,453 --> 00:14:21,038
I couldn't even go to school.

220
00:14:22,957 --> 00:14:25,501
If only I hadn't stopped
to pick up her bag.

221
00:14:26,127 --> 00:14:29,589
And if… I regretted that moment
again and again in my head,

222
00:14:29,672 --> 00:14:30,590
I still do.

223
00:14:32,675 --> 00:14:36,512
My homeroom teacher,
my mom, and Arisa helped me.

224
00:14:37,179 --> 00:14:38,431
And I moved away.

225
00:14:39,015 --> 00:14:42,059
And started living alone
so no one could find my address.

226
00:14:43,603 --> 00:14:46,564
I got to a place
where I could live a normal life,

227
00:14:47,481 --> 00:14:50,860
but I still feel sick when people stare,
and when girls approach me.

228
00:14:52,486 --> 00:14:55,948
I'm just a spineless loser
so all I can do is be cold,

229
00:14:56,032 --> 00:14:58,117
and put up walls to protect myself.

230
00:14:59,243 --> 00:15:04,040
Even when my dad came at me,
I was too weak to defend myself.

231
00:15:05,541 --> 00:15:06,709
All of it happened

232
00:15:07,376 --> 00:15:10,504
because I don't make genuine relationships
and let people in.

233
00:15:11,088 --> 00:15:13,716
None of my classmates believed
a word that I said,

234
00:15:14,383 --> 00:15:16,093
and all of it is my fault.

235
00:15:19,430 --> 00:15:22,516
Kazuki, stop me if you hate it.

236
00:15:23,100 --> 00:15:25,019
'Cause I'm gonna hug you now.

237
00:15:29,941 --> 00:15:32,109
None of this is any of your fault.

238
00:15:33,110 --> 00:15:34,987
I'm so mad.

239
00:15:35,071 --> 00:15:37,031
If only
we had become friends sooner.

240
00:15:37,823 --> 00:15:41,118
I would have believed you,
even when nobody else did.

241
00:15:45,665 --> 00:15:49,377
I feel the same way.
I wish I had met you sooner too.

242
00:15:53,172 --> 00:15:55,091
I went ahead
and contacted the police.

243
00:15:56,092 --> 00:15:58,094
We're gonna have to be guarded
for a while.

244
00:15:58,594 --> 00:16:00,680
I'm sorry you're dealing with this.

245
00:16:01,681 --> 00:16:02,974
It's because I'm weak.

246
00:16:03,599 --> 00:16:04,892
It's so embarrassing.

247
00:16:06,185 --> 00:16:07,687
Hey, that's not true.

248
00:16:09,397 --> 00:16:11,941
Don't worry. I'm right here.

249
00:16:15,361 --> 00:16:17,613
Social media
can be really problematic.

250
00:16:17,697 --> 00:16:20,157
I can't believe how fast she found you.

251
00:16:20,241 --> 00:16:21,117
Hmm.

252
00:16:22,868 --> 00:16:26,122
Well, I'll stay over on the days
that I don't have to work.

253
00:16:26,205 --> 00:16:28,082
You don't have to do that.

254
00:16:29,667 --> 00:16:31,419
I'm sure you're busy as well.

255
00:16:34,380 --> 00:16:36,215
Listen.

256
00:16:37,550 --> 00:16:40,636
I know you're mature for your age,
but you're still just a kid.

257
00:16:41,721 --> 00:16:44,640
So, let people help you
when you need it.

258
00:16:47,226 --> 00:16:49,145
Would you let it go with this kid?

259
00:16:50,646 --> 00:16:54,191
You're causing too much trouble now.

260
00:16:54,275 --> 00:16:58,571
We can't just keep running
to your uncle every time you do this.

261
00:16:58,654 --> 00:17:01,866
Jeez, I don't believe any of this
would have happened

262
00:17:01,949 --> 00:17:04,076
if this damn guy didn't lead you on…

263
00:17:04,160 --> 00:17:06,203
Don't say that about Tsukasa!

264
00:17:08,122 --> 00:17:10,374
When I was getting bullied
at work every day,

265
00:17:11,625 --> 00:17:14,170
Tsukasa was such a sweetheart to me.

266
00:17:15,504 --> 00:17:17,423
Every day, he would come visit.

267
00:17:18,507 --> 00:17:21,719
And we talked about,
well, anything all day.

268
00:17:24,597 --> 00:17:26,724
How could he do this to you?

269
00:17:26,807 --> 00:17:28,809
I wanna take him to court.

270
00:17:30,936 --> 00:17:33,105
We were only
seeing each other, nothing more.

271
00:17:34,148 --> 00:17:36,442
It's not anybody else's business but ours.

272
00:17:37,026 --> 00:17:41,530
And now yet another girl
is getting too close to my Tsukasa!

273
00:17:49,205 --> 00:17:50,539
She's in the way.

274
00:17:52,333 --> 00:17:55,461
Ah, Hoshino,
you can go after you finish cleaning that.

275
00:17:56,212 --> 00:17:57,046
Okay.

276
00:18:00,257 --> 00:18:03,552
What's up? You don't normally look upset.

277
00:18:04,053 --> 00:18:05,471
Huh? Um…

278
00:18:06,347 --> 00:18:07,556
Uh…

279
00:18:08,307 --> 00:18:09,475
Yeah…

280
00:18:10,768 --> 00:18:12,561
We don't have
any customers right now,

281
00:18:12,645 --> 00:18:14,480
so I'm happy to lend you an ear.

282
00:18:15,731 --> 00:18:19,944
But don't get excited, I'm not worried
about you or anything silly like that.

283
00:18:20,027 --> 00:18:22,488
Will you chill out
with the hot and cold, Hijiri?

284
00:18:24,490 --> 00:18:26,992
He texted a few times yesterday
to check on me.

285
00:18:27,827 --> 00:18:30,454
In his own way, he's making sure I'm okay.

286
00:18:30,538 --> 00:18:31,997
ARE YOU OKAY?
IF YOU ARE OKAY, IT'S FINE

287
00:18:33,124 --> 00:18:36,210
I was just thinking about
what I might be able to do

288
00:18:36,293 --> 00:18:38,420
to, uh, help out a friend of mine.

289
00:18:42,258 --> 00:18:44,135
Well,
as long as you're near them,

290
00:18:44,218 --> 00:18:45,886
I'm sure everything will be all right.

291
00:18:47,179 --> 00:18:48,139
Huh?

292
00:18:51,142 --> 00:18:55,187
Wait, what?
So that's what you think about me, huh?

293
00:18:55,271 --> 00:18:56,397
Please don't touch me.

294
00:19:00,901 --> 00:19:03,904
Aw, shoot. Hoshino already left, huh?

295
00:19:04,405 --> 00:19:06,365
Well, she forgot her phone here.

296
00:19:07,992 --> 00:19:10,953
If we run, we can catch her.
I'll just send Tsuchiya.

297
00:19:11,036 --> 00:19:12,788
How can I help, sir?

298
00:19:12,872 --> 00:19:14,790
I've been wondering all this time,

299
00:19:14,874 --> 00:19:17,084
what country are you the prince of,
Mr. Koganei?

300
00:19:17,751 --> 00:19:20,838
Hi there. Is Anzu in the back?

301
00:19:21,505 --> 00:19:22,798
No, she just left.

302
00:19:23,424 --> 00:19:27,428
What? She sent a text asking me
to come pick her up with my brother.

303
00:19:28,387 --> 00:19:29,805
Uh…

304
00:19:31,182 --> 00:19:36,979
Oh, shoot! Did I forget my phone?

305
00:19:37,062 --> 00:19:39,356
What a drag. Oh?

306
00:19:41,942 --> 00:19:42,943
Hey.

307
00:19:46,447 --> 00:19:48,782
We're gonna need you
to come over here with us.

308
00:19:48,866 --> 00:19:51,160
Huh? What? Who are you?

309
00:19:51,243 --> 00:19:52,369
I'm sorry, girl,

310
00:19:52,453 --> 00:19:55,998
but we were told to make sure
you can't be out in public.

311
00:20:03,464 --> 00:20:04,298
Huh?

312
00:20:04,381 --> 00:20:05,549
Huh?

313
00:20:08,260 --> 00:20:11,305
What are you doing? Get away from Anzu.

314
00:20:12,056 --> 00:20:13,057
Uh, Junta…

315
00:20:13,140 --> 00:20:14,808
Damn it…

316
00:20:15,392 --> 00:20:17,269
Who the hell is this brat?

317
00:20:22,900 --> 00:20:23,901
Ryuya!

318
00:20:23,984 --> 00:20:25,903
Tonta, stay out of it!

319
00:20:25,986 --> 00:20:27,988
You can get kicked off the team!

320
00:20:34,662 --> 00:20:36,664
Hey, back off!

321
00:20:38,832 --> 00:20:41,502
Pardon, I'm not sure what's going on here,

322
00:20:41,585 --> 00:20:43,545
but I'm afraid I'll have to stop you.

323
00:20:46,882 --> 00:20:48,175
Mr. Tsuchiya!

324
00:20:48,259 --> 00:20:51,845
Miss Hoshino, my sincerest apologies.
I'm sorry to intrude.

325
00:20:52,429 --> 00:20:54,556
But I'm here to deliver
something you forgot.

326
00:20:58,477 --> 00:20:59,853
The hell, man?

327
00:21:05,192 --> 00:21:08,028
Hold up, you guys. Naoki, is that you?

328
00:21:08,112 --> 00:21:10,114
Mr. Takamine!

329
00:21:10,781 --> 00:21:12,908
Wanna tell me what the hell you're doing?

330
00:21:12,992 --> 00:21:14,618
I'm so sorry.

331
00:21:15,369 --> 00:21:18,914
We had no choice.
This crazy chick threatens us.

332
00:21:25,212 --> 00:21:26,672
Was she around 20?

333
00:21:26,755 --> 00:21:29,174
Did she have really dark hair,
to about here?

334
00:21:29,258 --> 00:21:30,676
Yeah, that's right.

335
00:21:32,011 --> 00:21:34,930
You two ain't getting off
easy for this, you hear?

336
00:21:35,514 --> 00:21:36,890
Right, Shades-y?

337
00:21:37,391 --> 00:21:38,767
I'm sorry. Shades-y, you said?

338
00:21:39,351 --> 00:21:41,520
Oh, brother,
was that supposed to be clever?

339
00:21:41,603 --> 00:21:42,521
Um…

340
00:21:45,816 --> 00:21:47,943
I'm okay, thanks to you guys.

341
00:21:48,736 --> 00:21:51,864
I just can't believe everyone showed up
with such great timing.

342
00:21:51,947 --> 00:21:55,451
Well, I mean, I did get
that super random text from you.

343
00:21:55,534 --> 00:21:57,119
What? A text?

344
00:21:57,202 --> 00:21:59,788
Yeah, and you messaged me
to bring my brother,

345
00:21:59,872 --> 00:22:01,957
-so I didn't know what to expect.
-Hmm?

346
00:22:02,041 --> 00:22:02,958
WANT TO GO TO THE ARCADE AFTER?

347
00:22:03,042 --> 00:22:04,335
Wait.

348
00:22:04,418 --> 00:22:05,252
WHEN DO YOU GET OFF?

349
00:22:05,336 --> 00:22:06,962
I don't remember sending any of these.

350
00:22:07,546 --> 00:22:09,089
I don't think you're safe here.

351
00:22:09,173 --> 00:22:11,550
You should really hurry home
and try to get some rest.

352
00:22:11,633 --> 00:22:14,470
Oh? Yeah, I'll go do that.

353
00:22:15,596 --> 00:22:17,890
Thank you all so much, seriously.

354
00:22:19,058 --> 00:22:21,477
What? I honestly can't believe it.

355
00:22:21,560 --> 00:22:24,480
I know, but thankfully
nothing serious happened.

356
00:22:25,064 --> 00:22:26,774
I should leave. I mean,

357
00:22:27,608 --> 00:22:29,985
after all that, I can't stay here.

358
00:22:34,406 --> 00:22:35,741
I won't let you.

359
00:22:36,325 --> 00:22:37,910
-You shouldn't have to suffer…
-Mm.

360
00:22:37,993 --> 00:22:39,828
…just because someone like her is
out there.

361
00:22:40,329 --> 00:22:42,331
Let's figure this out as a team.

362
00:22:46,585 --> 00:22:47,503
Thanks.

363
00:22:51,507 --> 00:22:53,509
Bad moods are a big no-no!

364
00:22:53,592 --> 00:22:57,429
This cute boy right here will help you
get into a good one!

365
00:22:58,138 --> 00:23:00,682
Kick rocks. You embody my negativity.

366
00:23:01,350 --> 00:23:04,186
Oh wow, you're hard.

367
00:23:04,770 --> 00:23:07,272
You know, I got you out
of that sticky situation

368
00:23:07,356 --> 00:23:09,358
by sending those texts to everyone
with your phone.

369
00:23:09,441 --> 00:23:11,860
What, it was you? You send the texts?

370
00:23:11,944 --> 00:23:13,028
Yes, ma'am.

371
00:23:13,529 --> 00:23:15,239
I set the whole thing up,

372
00:23:15,322 --> 00:23:18,409
so that all of the pawns
would come running to protect you.

373
00:23:18,492 --> 00:23:19,952
Don't you dare call them "pawns"!

374
00:23:23,247 --> 00:23:26,208
Anyway, thank you.
You really saved my life.

375
00:23:26,291 --> 00:23:27,960
First time I'm grateful for you.

376
00:23:28,043 --> 00:23:29,711
An ant's booger's worth.

377
00:23:29,795 --> 00:23:31,505
A microscopic level, oh!

378
00:23:32,631 --> 00:23:36,677
Look, if you're a wizard,
can't you do something about this stalker?

379
00:23:36,760 --> 00:23:40,055
Like, put up a barrier, maybe,
that keeps her from finding Kazuki.

380
00:23:40,973 --> 00:23:42,141
Hmm.

381
00:23:42,724 --> 00:23:44,643
I'm only able to use my magic,

382
00:23:44,726 --> 00:23:47,563
if it contributes
to your romantic relationship somehow.

383
00:23:48,397 --> 00:23:49,565
Here's the thing.

384
00:23:49,648 --> 00:23:50,732
If you do nothing about it,

385
00:23:50,816 --> 00:23:53,569
then you would be exposing me to danger,
am I right?

386
00:23:53,652 --> 00:23:55,028
Whoa…

387
00:23:55,612 --> 00:23:58,949
Well, if it's true you're going
to be exposed to future danger,

388
00:23:59,533 --> 00:24:02,703
I'll just have to remove Kazuki
from your potential partner options.

389
00:24:05,038 --> 00:24:07,499
Gotta eliminate those risky pawns,
am I right?

390
00:24:11,920 --> 00:24:12,754
Heh?

391
00:24:12,838 --> 00:24:14,256
No!

392
00:24:20,012 --> 00:24:22,264
I'm done talking
to anyone without a heart.

393
00:24:22,347 --> 00:24:23,682
Get out.

394
00:24:25,809 --> 00:24:27,102
Aw, jeez.

395
00:24:33,317 --> 00:24:36,528
Well, now I won't be able
to use my magic again for a while.

396
00:24:41,825 --> 00:24:43,368
I can't fall asleep.

397
00:24:44,369 --> 00:24:45,704
I'm really thirsty.

398
00:24:48,373 --> 00:24:51,710
Sorry Junta, for putting Hoshino
in all this danger.

399
00:24:52,294 --> 00:24:53,795
Why are you apologizing?

400
00:24:54,546 --> 00:24:57,049
You shouldn't feel responsible

401
00:24:57,132 --> 00:24:58,050
for any of this stuff.

402
00:24:58,842 --> 00:24:59,801
Hmm.

403
00:25:00,636 --> 00:25:04,181
Luckily, Anzu didn't get hurt
this time around.

404
00:25:04,890 --> 00:25:07,017
But I won't let that stalker do this.

405
00:25:07,893 --> 00:25:12,147
I swear, if she threatens Anzu again,
I don't know what I'm gonna do.

406
00:25:13,815 --> 00:25:16,151
If it gets me kicked off the team,
then so be it.

407
00:25:17,778 --> 00:25:19,530
I've made up my mind now,

408
00:25:20,155 --> 00:25:23,659
and I have no regrets.
It's got nothing to do with you.

409
00:25:26,078 --> 00:25:29,540
Truth is, the reason
I started playing baseball was…

410
00:25:30,165 --> 00:25:32,626
-What kind of guys do you like, Anzu?
-Hmm?

411
00:25:32,709 --> 00:25:34,086
Hmm…

412
00:25:34,795 --> 00:25:36,588
Someone who's super athletic!

413
00:25:36,672 --> 00:25:38,465
And can beat the boss!

414
00:25:38,549 --> 00:25:40,092
Those were her exact words.

415
00:25:43,303 --> 00:25:45,722
Tonta, you got
great hand-eye coordination.

416
00:25:45,806 --> 00:25:47,558
Would rock at baseball, I bet.

417
00:25:48,183 --> 00:25:51,103
So, I picked up baseball
in middle school.

418
00:25:51,186 --> 00:25:52,980
Because of what Anzu said.

419
00:25:54,690 --> 00:25:56,149
Hey dude, don't laugh.

420
00:25:56,733 --> 00:25:59,570
No, I'm sorry. I'm sure she has no idea

421
00:25:59,653 --> 00:26:01,947
she was so influential, that's all.

422
00:26:07,953 --> 00:26:09,580
Totally. Oh?

423
00:26:10,372 --> 00:26:11,832
Hi.

424
00:26:16,920 --> 00:26:19,423
Has everything been okay
since the night we spoke?

425
00:26:19,506 --> 00:26:20,340
CONBINI MART

426
00:26:21,216 --> 00:26:22,217
Mm-hm.

427
00:26:22,301 --> 00:26:24,344
Haven't had anything happen since.

428
00:26:24,428 --> 00:26:27,889
Kazuki and his sister
are gonna walk me home after work today.

429
00:26:28,849 --> 00:26:32,811
That's good. But if you ever need
Tsuchiya, you can ask any time.

430
00:26:34,730 --> 00:26:37,441
Well, thank you.
And if the boss was here, he'd say,

431
00:26:37,524 --> 00:26:39,776
"In what country are you an oil tycoon?"

432
00:26:39,860 --> 00:26:41,737
You know he'd say that, right?

433
00:26:41,820 --> 00:26:43,196
Yeah, he asked me already.

434
00:26:45,407 --> 00:26:47,993
Anyway, not even a king
nor an emperor

435
00:26:48,076 --> 00:26:50,120
would interest you at all, right?

436
00:26:50,203 --> 00:26:52,623
Huh? Well, yeah.

437
00:26:56,752 --> 00:26:58,712
All right, break's over now.

438
00:26:58,795 --> 00:27:01,381
-Yeah, I'm gonna head home.
-Good night.

439
00:27:06,053 --> 00:27:07,888
-Miss Hoshino.
-Huh?

440
00:27:13,435 --> 00:27:15,395
Excuse me. You got a minute?

441
00:27:16,396 --> 00:27:18,857
Kishi. Oh, shoot.

442
00:27:18,940 --> 00:27:20,901
Tsukasa and Arisa are coming to get me.

443
00:27:21,485 --> 00:27:23,612
They'll be here any sec.
I can't let them see her.

444
00:27:23,695 --> 00:27:24,738
What do you want?

445
00:27:26,156 --> 00:27:27,908
I have something for you.

446
00:27:33,455 --> 00:27:34,998
A fanfare, please!

447
00:27:35,082 --> 00:27:37,167
And a big congratulations!

448
00:27:37,250 --> 00:27:39,419
Did you fall for my little trick?

449
00:27:39,503 --> 00:27:42,589
I bet now you don't feel like
skipping the ending, right?

450
00:27:42,673 --> 00:27:46,343
In today's world, you can watch
whatever you want at your own convenience.

451
00:27:46,426 --> 00:27:49,096
But don't you think in that process
we've also lost something?

452
00:27:49,179 --> 00:27:51,473
Don't just let things be! Come on!

453
00:27:51,556 --> 00:27:54,142
Let's go on a super-duper happy adventure!

454
00:27:54,226 --> 00:27:56,144
So I can make sure I get paid.

